    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Utopia Theater】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Dungeon Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Solo/Duo Dungeon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Features: </>\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragments: </>Players have a chance to obtain residual memories dropped by defeated marionettes that have suffered a loss of control. You can choose various memory fragments to strengthen your abilities, constantly growing and changing to face stronger challenges on each floor.\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragment Gifting: </>In duo mode, players can use the Memory Retrace function in the memory fragment interface to convert their own memory fragments into a retraceable form that teammates can pick up, allowing you to share fragments and grow together.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Normal Difficulty: </>Level 30\n    <Assistant_Property1>Hard Difficulty: </>Level 30, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n    <Assistant_Property1>Nightmare Difficulty: </>Level 61, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - </>{JumpToUI:[乌托邦剧院]|1302351}to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Party Size: </>Enter solo or as a duo.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Random Marionette Fragment Box, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>First-Clear Rewards for Each Difficulty: </>Bound Pounds, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n    <Assistant_Property1>Weekly Progress Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n<Assistant_Red>Each difficulty provides 1 first-clear reward; you can earn progress rewards up to a limit of 1200 Stage Echoes per week.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Bonus: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Players who form a Covenant relationship</>and enter duo mode will receive extra resurrection counts and extra Marionette Essence (used for purchasing important items within the dungeon)."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Utopia Theater】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Dungeon Type: </><Assistant_Property1>Solo/Duo Dungeon</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Features: </>\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragments: </>Players have a chance to obtain residual memories dropped by defeated marionettes that have suffered a loss of control. You can choose various memory fragments to strengthen your abilities, constantly growing and changing to face stronger challenges on each floor.\n  <Assistant_Property1>Memory Fragment Gifting: </>In duo mode, players can use the Memory Retrace function in the memory fragment interface to convert their own memory fragments into a retraceable form that teammates can pick up, allowing you to share fragments and grow together.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Normal Difficulty: </>Level 30\n    <Assistant_Property1>Hard Difficulty: </>Level 30, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n    <Assistant_Property1>Nightmare Difficulty: </>Level 61, unlocked after clearing Normal Difficulty\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Participate: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - World Adventure - Dungeon - </>{JumpToUI:[Utopia Theater]|1302351}to participate.\n<Assistant_Title2>Party Size: </>Enter solo or as a duo.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Random Marionette Fragment Box, etc.\n    <Assistant_Property1>First-Clear Rewards for Each Difficulty: </>Bound Pounds, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n    <Assistant_Property1>Weekly Progress Rewards: </>World Adventure Chest, Gold Thread, Purple/Gold Random Marionette Fragment Box\n<Assistant_Red>Each difficulty provides 1 first-clear reward; you can earn progress rewards up to a limit of 1200 Stage Echoes per week.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Covenant Bonus: </>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Players who form a Covenant relationship</>and enter duo mode will receive extra resurrection counts and extra Marionette Essence (used for purchasing important items within the dungeon).",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>烙印装备</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>装备说明：</>烙印装备带有专属的烙印词条效果，但不带有套装效果。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>获取途径：</>\n\n1、参与副本玩法，可获得冒险倾向的烙印装备。\n\n2、开启以战养战秘宝，或在报销商店中兑换，可获得竞技倾向的烙印装备。\n\n3、此外，还可通过完成任务和探索获取烙印装备。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Imprint Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Description: </> Imprint equipment comes with exclusive imprint affix effects but does not have set bonuses. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Sources: </>\n\n 1. Participate in dungeon activities to obtain adventure-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 2. Open War-forged treasures or exchange in the Reimbursement Shop to obtain competition-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 3. Additionally, imprint equipment can be obtained by completing quests and exploration.",
