    ["每<Highlight>20进度</>获得1个养成资源箱，打开可随机获得一件<Highlight>66装等</>的橙色或金色品质装备，以及可在<Highlight>交易集市</>兑换<Highlight>可交易物装等</>的交易之契，<Highlight>可交易</>金纺线、非凡物质、药品食物等。"] = "Every <Highlight>20 progress </>, receive 1 growth resource chest. Opening it grants a random piece of <Highlight>Level 66</> orange or gold quality Equipment, as well as a Trading Contract that can be exchanged at the <Highlight>Trading Market</> for <Highlight>tradable item level</> items, <Highlight>tradable</> Gold Spun Thread, Beyonder materials, medicine, food, etc.",
